        S(
            "Polysubstance use: full picture dena zaroori",
            "Alcohol + opioids, opioids + sedatives, alcohol + sedatives, stimulants + depressants, or nicotine/cannabis alongside other use can change withdrawal, overdose and medication decisions. Kabhi primary substance obvious nahi hota. Treatment plan ko full sequence samajhna hai: kya use hota hai, kis order mein, kis reason se, aur kis combination mein. ‘Main problem sirf alcohol hai’ kehkar sleeping pills chhupana unsafe ho sakta hai.",
            "Integrated assessment mein mental health, pain, sleep, trauma, relationships and sexual behaviour bhi relevant ho sakte hain. Substance use ke time consent impaired ho sakta hai; sexual risk/non-consensual situations ko bhi clinician ke saath safety planning mein include karo. Har substance ko alag doctor ko partial information ke saath treat karwana interactions miss kar sakta hai; prescriber list share karo. One coordinated plan is safer than disconnected instructions.",
            exercise=("My full-use timeline", ["All substances/medicines used, including alcohol and sleep aids.", "Approximate amount/frequency and last-use times.", "Combinations and reasons for each.", "Previous withdrawal/overdose/mental-health events.", "All prescribers/services involved and next coordinated appointment."]),
        ),
